{"title": "Ardent Apostle (Condition)", "pageid": 34543, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ardent_Apostle_(Condition)", "categories": ["No stack ID", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ardent Apostle Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Ardent_Apostle_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Ardent Apostle</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Offering their cries of pain without protection. Has a +4 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\">Performance</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Intimidation\" title=\"Intimidation\">Intimidation</a> checks. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">GOB_PENITENT</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_PENITENT+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_PENITENT+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Ardent_Apostle\">Sources of Ardent Apostle</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Removing <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a> before letting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abdirak\" title=\"Abdirak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/25px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/38px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/50px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Abdirak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png/25px-Portrait_Abdirak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Portrait_Abdirak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Abdirak\" title=\"Abdirak\">Abdirak</a> hit a party member in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition is temporary and is removed once <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar%27s_Love_(Condition)\" title=\"Loviatar's Love (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loviatar's Love\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Loviatar%27s_Love_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar%27s_Love_(Condition)\" title=\"Loviatar's Love (Condition)\">Loviatar's Love</a> is obtained.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"what if the encounter end...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200029\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1261/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12777/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6014/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1104067/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.656      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   47.656      1 -total\n 41.86%   19.950      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.83%    8.020      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 14.28%    6.804